    "detailed_description": "<h1>While you wait, check out Picayune Dreams!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What am I in for?</strong></h2>Welcome to the world of Endacopia! You're in for a surreal Point and Click Adventure full of unsolved mysteries, abstract puzzles, hostile monsters, and horrors that lurk in the shadows... if tampered with, of course. You'll be guiding a young boy named Mellow who has lost all his senses in an attempt to escape an uncomfortable home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What do I do?</strong></h2>First and foremost, you'll need a functional keyboard and mouse to play this game. Once you've taken care of that, prepare yourself to use your brain for the following scenarios:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Decide which area to explore next in whichever order you'd like.<br></li><li>Use Mellow's bare fists to block, dodge, and punch monsters in first person perspective.<br></li><li>Have conversations with strange individuals who may or may not help you on your quests.<br></li><li>Fill your pockets with tools, toys, gadgets, and trash.<br></li><li>Try your luck at a variety of mini-games.<br></li><li>Gaze at an abundance of animated background gags. <br></li><li>Uncover disturbing secrets that were probably better left hidden.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What am I in for?</strong></h2>Welcome to the world of Endacopia! You're in for a surreal Point and Click Adventure full of unsolved mysteries, abstract puzzles, hostile monsters, and horrors that lurk in the shadows... if tampered with, of course. You'll be guiding a young boy named Mellow who has lost all his senses in an attempt to escape an uncomfortable home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What do I do?</strong></h2>First and foremost, you'll need a functional keyboard and mouse to play this game. Once you've taken care of that, prepare yourself to use your brain for the following scenarios:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Decide which area to explore next in whichever order you'd like.<br></li><li>Use Mellow's bare fists to block, dodge, and punch monsters in first person perspective.<br></li><li>Have conversations with strange individuals who may or may not help you on your quests.<br></li><li>Fill your pockets with tools, toys, gadgets, and trash.<br></li><li>Try your luck at a variety of mini-games.<br></li><li>Gaze at an abundance of animated background gags. <br></li><li>Uncover disturbing secrets that were probably better left hidden.</li></ul>",
